# The OpenEMR fork submodule - ~85MB of PHP that the sidecar image has no use for. Without this it
# is uploaded to the daemon on every sidecar build. It builds via docker-compose.build-openemr.yml,
# whose context is external/agent-forge itself, so excluding it here costs nothing.
external/
